{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sistema de Solicitudes — Juarez de Oriente",
    "description": "## Instrucciones\n1. Ejecuta **Auth / Login** primero. El token se guarda automáticamente en {{token}}.\n2. Ejecuta **Buscar proveedores** y **Buscar trabajadores** para obtener sus IDs.\n3. El flujo es: **Crear y emitir solicitud** (incluye artículos en el body) → editar con PATCH si es necesario → cancelar/restaurar.\n\n## Notas importantes\n- `POST /requests` crea y emite en un solo paso — no hay endpoint separado para crear borrador.\n- `solicitanteId` solo se puede definir al crear la solicitud; el PATCH no lo soporta (limitación del backend).\n- El PDF se genera en el frontend; no existe endpoint de PDF en el backend.\n\n## Datos de prueba (seeds)\n**Usuarios:** admin/Admin123! (ADMIN) | capturista/Capturista1! (CAPTURISTA)\n**Proveedores:** PROV-001, PROV-002, PROV-003\n**Trabajadores:** EMP-001 Juan Carlos, EMP-002 Maria Guadalupe, EMP-003 Pedro",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",    "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "token",      "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId",     "value": "" },
    { "key": "supplierId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "workerId",   "value": "" },
    { "key": "requestId",  "value": "" },
    { "key": "itemId",     "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Autenticación JWT. Ejecuta Login antes de cualquier otro endpoint.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.data.user.id);",
            "    pm.test('Login exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "    console.log('Token guardado. Usuario:', json.data.user.username, '| Roles:', JSON.stringify(json.data.user.roles));",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Credenciales disponibles:\n- admin / Admin123! (ADMIN — acceso total)\n- capturista / Capturista1! (CAPTURISTA)\n\nEl token JWT se guarda en {{token}} y el userId en {{userId}} automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
            "    pm.test('Token renovado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "    console.log('Token renovado correctamente');",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","refresh"] },
            "description": "Renueva el access token usando el refresh token almacenado en cookie HttpOnly.\nNo requiere body ni header Authorization — usa la cookie de sesión.\nActualiza {{token}} automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","me"] },
            "description": "Retorna los datos del usuario autenticado actualmente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","change-password"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"Admin123!\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NuevoAdmin123!\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","logout"] },
            "description": "Invalida el refresh token (cookie). El access token sigue válido hasta que expire."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
      "description": "Gestión de usuarios. Solo rol ADMIN.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","users"],
              "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "20" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener usuario por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","users","{{userId}}"] },
            "description": "{{userId}} se guarda automáticamente al hacer Login o Crear usuario."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear usuario",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) { pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.data.id); console.log('userId guardado:', json.data.id); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","users"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"auditor1\",\n  \"password\": \"Auditor123!\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Auditor de Prueba\",\n  \"phone\": \"773-300-0001\",\n  \"roles\": [\"AUDITOR\"]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Roles disponibles: ADMIN | CAPTURISTA | AUTORIZADOR | AUDITOR\nLa contraseña debe tener mínimo 8 caracteres, una mayúscula y un número."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","users","{{userId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Nombre Actualizado\",\n  \"phone\": \"773-999-9999\",\n  \"roles\": [\"CAPTURISTA\"],\n  \"active\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Todos los campos son opcionales. active: false desactiva al usuario."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","users","{{userId}}"] },
            "description": "Elimina el usuario permanentemente. Solo ADMIN.\nNo se puede eliminar al propio usuario autenticado."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Proveedores",
      "description": "Catálogo de proveedores.\n\nEjecuta Buscar primero para obtener el supplierId que necesitas en las solicitudes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar proveedores",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data && json.data.content && json.data.content.length > 0) {",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('supplierId', json.data.content[0].id);",
            "    console.log('supplierId guardado:', json.data.content[0].id, '|', json.data.content[0].name);",
            "    console.log('--- Lista de proveedores disponibles ---');",
            "    json.data.content.forEach(s => console.log(s.id, '|', s.code, '|', s.name));",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","suppliers"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q",      "value": "",     "disabled": true,  "description": "Texto libre: busca en clave (PROV-001) o nombre" },
                { "key": "active", "value": "true", "disabled": true,  "description": "true = activos | false = inactivos | omitir = todos" },
                { "key": "page",   "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size",   "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "El script de Tests guarda el primer proveedor en {{supplierId}} y muestra todos en la consola.\n\nSeeds disponibles: PROV-001, PROV-002, PROV-003"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener proveedor por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","suppliers","{{supplierId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear proveedor",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) { pm.collectionVariables.set('supplierId', json.data.id); console.log('supplierId guardado:', json.data.id); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","suppliers"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"PROV-004\",\n  \"name\": \"PAPELERIA Y OFICINA CENTRAL\",\n  \"phone\": \"773-400-0004\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "La clave (code) debe ser única. Se normaliza a mayúsculas automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar proveedor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","suppliers","{{supplierId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"PAPELERIA Y OFICINA CENTRAL ACTUALIZADA\",\n  \"phone\": \"773-400-9999\",\n  \"active\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desactivar proveedor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","suppliers","{{supplierId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"active\": false\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trabajadores",
      "description": "Catálogo de trabajadores y socios.\n\nEjecuta Buscar primero para obtener el workerId.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar trabajadores",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data && json.data.content && json.data.content.length > 0) {",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('workerId', json.data.content[0].id);",
            "    console.log('workerId guardado:', json.data.content[0].id, '|', json.data.content[0].name);",
            "    console.log('--- Lista de trabajadores disponibles ---');",
            "    json.data.content.forEach(w => console.log(w.id, '|', w.name, '('+w.workerType+')'));",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workers?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","workers"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q",      "value": "",     "disabled": true, "description": "Busca en nombre, clave empresa (EMP-001) o numero empleado" },
                { "key": "active", "value": "true", "disabled": true, "description": "true = activos | false = inactivos | omitir = todos" },
                { "key": "page",   "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size",   "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "El script guarda el primer trabajador en {{workerId}} y muestra todos en consola.\n\nSeeds: EMP-001 Juan Carlos (SOCIO), EMP-002 Maria Guadalupe (SOCIO), EMP-003 Pedro (EVENTUAL)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener trabajador por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workers/{{workerId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","workers","{{workerId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear trabajador",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) { pm.collectionVariables.set('workerId', json.data.id); console.log('workerId guardado:', json.data.id); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workers", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","workers"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"companyCode\": \"EMP-004\",\n  \"employeeNumber\": \"0004\",\n  \"name\": \"ANA LUCIA GOMEZ RAMIREZ\",\n  \"phone\": \"773-500-0004\",\n  \"workerType\": \"SOCIO\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "workerType: SOCIO o EVENTUAL\ncompanyCode y employeeNumber son opcionales."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar trabajador",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workers/{{workerId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","workers","{{workerId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"ANA LUCIA GOMEZ ACTUALIZADA\",\n  \"workerType\": \"SOCIO\",\n  \"active\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Solicitudes",
      "description": "Flujo principal:\n1. Buscar proveedores → obtener supplierId\n2. Buscar trabajadores → obtener workerId (opcional para el solicitante)\n3. Crear y emitir solicitud (incluye artículos en el body)\n4. Editar campos con PATCH si es necesario\n5. Cancelar o restaurar según sea el caso\n\nNOTA: solicitanteId solo se puede asignar al crear la solicitud. El PATCH no lo soporta.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar solicitudes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "folio",           "value": "704",            "disabled": true, "description": "Número de folio exacto (ej: 704). Es un número, NO el código del proveedor." },
                { "key": "supplierId",      "value": "{{supplierId}}", "disabled": true, "description": "UUID del proveedor. Primero ejecuta Buscar proveedores." },
                { "key": "workerId",        "value": "{{workerId}}",   "disabled": true, "description": "UUID del trabajador en algún renglón. Primero ejecuta Buscar trabajadores." },
                { "key": "status",          "value": "EMITIDA",        "disabled": true, "description": "BORRADOR | EMITIDA | CANCELADA" },
                { "key": "createdBy",       "value": "{{userId}}",     "disabled": true, "description": "UUID del usuario que creó la solicitud." },
                { "key": "from",            "value": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "disabled": true, "description": "Fecha inicio ISO 8601" },
                { "key": "to",              "value": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z", "disabled": true, "description": "Fecha fin ISO 8601" },
                { "key": "excludeCancelled","value": "false",          "disabled": true, "description": "true = excluye CANCELADA de los resultados" },
                { "key": "page",            "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size",            "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "CAPTURISTA solo ve sus propias solicitudes — el filtro createdBy se aplica automáticamente.\nADMIN ve todas a menos que especifique createdBy."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Estadísticas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/stats", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","stats"] },
            "description": "Retorna conteo de BORRADOR, EMITIDA y CANCELADA, más las 5 solicitudes más recientes.\nCAPTURISTA solo ve sus propias estadísticas; ADMIN ve totales."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener solicitud por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}"] },
            "description": "{{requestId}} se guarda automáticamente al crear una solicitud."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear y emitir solicitud",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) {",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('requestId', json.data.id);",
            "    if (json.data.items && json.data.items.length > 0) {",
            "        pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', json.data.items[0].id);",
            "        console.log('itemId del primer renglón guardado:', json.data.items[0].id);",
            "    }",
            "    pm.test('Solicitud creada (201)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "    pm.test('Estado EMITIDA', () => pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('EMITIDA'));",
            "    pm.test('Folio asignado', () => pm.expect(json.data.folio).to.be.a('number'));",
            "    console.log('requestId guardado:', json.data.id);",
            "    console.log('Folio:', json.data.folioFormatted, '| Renglones:', json.data.items.length);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"supplierId\": \"{{supplierId}}\",\n  \"solicitanteId\": \"{{workerId}}\",\n  \"destination\": \"Mantenimiento preventivo de instalaciones — planta baja\",\n  \"authorizer\": \"Sr. Miguel Angel Luna\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"workerId\": \"{{workerId}}\",\n      \"description\": \"PINTURA VINILICA BLANCA EN GALON\",\n      \"quantity\": 4,\n      \"unit\": \"GAL\",\n      \"unitCost\": 185.50\n    },\n    {\n      \"workerId\": null,\n      \"description\": \"BROCHA DE 4 PULGADAS\",\n      \"quantity\": 6,\n      \"unit\": \"PZA\",\n      \"unitCost\": 45.00\n    }\n  ]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Crea y emite la solicitud en un solo paso. Requiere al menos un artículo en items.\n\nCampos:\n- supplierId: UUID del proveedor (obligatorio)\n- solicitanteId: UUID del trabajador solicitante (opcional) — solo se puede asignar aquí, no en el PATCH\n- destination: descripción del uso (obligatorio, máx 1000 caracteres)\n- authorizer: nombre de quien autoriza (opcional)\n- items: array con al menos 1 artículo (obligatorio)\n  - workerId: UUID del trabajador del renglón (opcional, puede ser null)\n  - description: descripción del artículo (obligatorio)\n  - quantity, unit, unitCost: opcionales\n\nEl folio se asigna automáticamente y la solicitud queda en estado EMITIDA."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar solicitud",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"supplierId\": \"{{supplierId}}\",\n  \"solicitanteId\": \"{{workerId}}\",\n  \"destination\": \"Destino actualizado — area de mantenimiento\",\n  \"authorizer\": \"Ing. Carlos Mendoza\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Actualiza campos de la solicitud. Aplica a BORRADOR y EMITIDA.\n\nCampos soportados:\n- supplierId: UUID del nuevo proveedor (opcional)\n- solicitanteId: UUID del nuevo solicitante, o null para quitarlo (opcional)\n- destination: texto de destino/propósito (opcional)\n- authorizer: nombre del autorizador (opcional)\n\nTodos los campos son opcionales — solo se aplican los que vengan en el body."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Agregar renglón",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data && json.data.items && json.data.items.length > 0) {",
            "    const last = json.data.items[json.data.items.length - 1];",
            "    pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', last.id);",
            "    console.log('itemId guardado:', last.id);",
            "    console.log('Total renglones:', json.data.items.length);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","items"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"workerId\": \"{{workerId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"SELLADOR ACRILICO EN CUÑETE\",\n  \"quantity\": 2,\n  \"unit\": \"CUÑ\",\n  \"unitCost\": 320.00\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Agrega un renglón a la solicitud. Funciona en estado BORRADOR y EMITIDA.\n\nCampos:\n- workerId: UUID del trabajador (opcional, puede ser null)\n- description: descripción del artículo (obligatorio)\n- quantity, unit, unitCost: opcionales\n\nEl total = quantity × unitCost se calcula en el servidor."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar renglón",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/items/{{itemId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","items","{{itemId}}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"workerId\": \"{{workerId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"PINTURA VINILICA BLANCA EN GALON — ACTUALIZADA\",\n  \"quantity\": 5,\n  \"unit\": \"GAL\",\n  \"unitCost\": 190.00\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Actualiza un renglón existente. Funciona en estado BORRADOR y EMITIDA.\n\n{{itemId}} se guarda automáticamente al agregar un renglón o al crear la solicitud."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar renglón",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/items/{{itemId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","items","{{itemId}}"] },
            "description": "Elimina un renglón. {{itemId}} se guarda al agregar o crear renglones."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar solicitud",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) {",
            "    pm.test('Estado CANCELADA', () => pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('CANCELADA'));",
            "    console.log('Cancelada. Folio conservado:', json.data.folioFormatted);",
            "    console.log('Motivo:', json.data.cancellationReason);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/cancel", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","cancel"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Proveedor no disponible en la fecha requerida\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Cancela la solicitud. El motivo es obligatorio.\n\nEl folio NO se reutiliza (trazabilidad). La solicitud pasa a la papelera."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Restaurar solicitud",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "if (json.data) {",
            "    pm.test('Estado EMITIDA', () => pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('EMITIDA'));",
            "    console.log('Restaurada. Folio:', json.data.folioFormatted);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/restore", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","restore"] },
            "description": "Restaura una solicitud CANCELADA al estado EMITIDA. Solo ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar solicitud permanentemente",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}"] },
            "description": "Elimina permanentemente una solicitud CANCELADA. Solo ADMIN.\n⚠️ Acción irreversible."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Vaciar papelera (todas las canceladas)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/trash/all", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","trash","all"] },
            "description": "Elimina permanentemente TODAS las solicitudes canceladas. Solo ADMIN.\n⚠️ Acción irreversible — no hay confirmación adicional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Historial de documentos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/documents", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","requests","{{requestId}}","documents"] },
            "description": "Lista los documentos PDF generados para esta solicitud, ordenados por fecha descendente.\nCada entrada tiene: id, templateVersion, fileSizeBytes, checksum, generatedAt."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Configuración",
      "description": "Configuración de empresa. No requiere autenticación.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener configuración",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","settings"] },
            "description": "Retorna la configuración pública de la empresa: nombre, dirección, RFC, teléfono, extensión y lista de autorizadores.\n\nNo requiere token — datos no sensibles usados por el frontend para generar PDFs."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditoria",
      "description": "Bitácora inmutable del sistema. Solo ADMIN o AUDITOR.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar eventos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-events?page=0&size=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","audit-events"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "actorId",    "value": "{{userId}}",     "disabled": true, "description": "UUID del usuario que realizó la acción." },
                { "key": "action",     "value": "REQUEST_ISSUED", "disabled": true, "description": "USER_CREATED | USER_DEACTIVATED | SUPPLIER_CREATED | WORKER_CREATED | REQUEST_ISSUED | REQUEST_CANCELLED" },
                { "key": "entityType", "value": "Request",        "disabled": true, "description": "User | Supplier | Worker | Request" },
                { "key": "from",       "value": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "to",         "value": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "page",       "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size",       "value": "50" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Resultados en orden descendente (más reciente primero). La bitácora es de solo lectura."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
